spine the clock to grip_strength_sensor for init
make a memory named battery_level with size 16
make a neuron named open_hand_button with threshold 1 and leak 0
nake a neuron named viberation_sensor with threshold 3 and leak 0
make a metamorphic router named secure_bus with key 8'hA1
flow the spike from viberation_sensor into the read of stabilize_grip
make a neuron named motor_lock with threshold 1 and leak 0         
morph the spike from open_hand_button through  secure bus to  motor_lock with key 8'hA1
make a state_machine named grip_state with states open, closing, locked
on press close_hand_btn transition from open to closing in grip_state

start the system                                                        
                                                                                                    
                                      
